Local modification by Norns: on Windows, include the current Flutter view ID
in TextInputConfiguration to support the Windows text input plugin.
Terminal/controller changes explicitly invalidate paint as well as layout,
so same-size SSH output and tab changes repaint without opening the keyboard.
Modified Enter keys with Control retain the modifier using CSI-u encoding,
shared by hardware and mobile accessory input instead of collapsing to CR.
